+	 * The RV220W discovery work hardware-qualified the reconstructed two-core
+	 * BCM4322 N-PHY4 / BCM2056r3 RX-IQ + RCCAL transaction in retained mode.
+	 * Use that implementation here for the exact qualified hardware so normal
+	 * b43 calibration/cache sequencing owns the lifecycle rather than a
